-mater-singing","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Elon Alma Mater","title":"Sing the Alma Mater’s Unusual First Line","subtitle":"The 1998 song explicitly remembers Elon’s coeducational founding","notes":"Read the university’s explanation of the lyrics, then join the song at a formal ceremony, major event or athletics contest when invited.","short_summary":"A campus song links Elon’s oaks, hilltop setting and coeducational history to communal ceremonies.","evidence_claim":"Elon states that students and alumni have sung the Alma Mater at formal ceremonies, athletic contests and major events since it was written in 1998.","source_url":"https://www.elon.edu/u/traditions/symbols-sayings/the-alma-mater/","source_title":"The Alma Mater | Elon Traditions | Elon University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Participation occurs when the Alma Mater is included in a ceremony, major event or athletic contest; access follows the host event’s rules.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"elon-presidents-holiday-party-students","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"President’s Holiday Party for Students","title":"Take the President’s Holiday-Party Photo","subtitle":"A late-1980s presidential reception evolved into a student celebration","notes":"Check the December invitation, enjoy the student performances, and use the themed photo setup for a lighthearted record of the semester.","short_summary":"Students gather for a presidential holiday reception featuring food, music and themed photographs.","evidence_claim":"Elon says the President’s Holiday Party for Students began in the late 1980s at Maynard House and now includes food, student musicians and photographs with the university president.","source_url":"https://www.elon.edu/u/traditions/events-activities/","source_title":"Events & Activities | Elon Traditions | 